  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 102.06 Adoption of Rules",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 102.06 Adoption of Rules. The commissioner shall adopt such rules as are needed and authorized by statute. Such rules shall be adopted in accordance with the provisions of the Administrative Procedure Act, RSA 541-A, where applicable.\n\nSource. #6486, eff 4-16-97",
